@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

participant "Game / SceneLogic" as Game
participant "SceneLayer" as Layer
participant "View\n(Camera + Viewport)" as View
participant "RenderSurfaceHost\n(Backbuffer)" as Host
participant "RenderSurfaceAdapter\n(control/window)" as Adapter

== World-space sprite/tile to screen ==

Game -> Layer: worldPos (tile/grid or worldPx)
activate Layer

Layer -> Layer: Compute worldPx\n(from grid/tile via CoordinateSystem)
Layer --> View: worldPx
deactivate Layer

activate View
View -> View: WorldToScreen(worldPx)\n(implicit in draw step)

note right of View
// Conceptual world -> screen mapping
screenX = (worldPx.X - Camera.PositionPx.X) * Zoom\n  + Viewport.TargetRectPx.Left
screenY = (worldPx.Y - Camera.PositionPx.Y) * Zoom\n  + Viewport.TargetRectPx.Top
end note

View -> Host: Draw sprite/tile at screenPx\n(on Backbuffer.Canvas)
deactivate View

activate Host
Host -> Adapter: Blit backbuffer\n(full frame or dirty rect)
deactivate Host

Adapter --> Adapter: Present to display

@enduml